[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":41,"col":10},"end":{"line":41,"col":21}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"This program's subscriptions depend on its model, and `browser-inline` compiles\na set of subscriptions that is the same for the page's life: a set that changes\nneeds the subscription diff, which arrives with slice S4 of\n`plans/direct-rewrite.md` §5 (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §3; §5, class 3).\nWrite `subscriptions` so that it does not read the model, and let `update`\nignore what it does not need."}]
